power: supply: add PMI8950 SMBCHG charger and fuel gauge drivers

Out-of-tree drivers taken unchanged from the msm8953-mainline kernel fork
(https://github.com/msm8953-mainline/linux, branch 7.1.3/main):

- drivers/power/supply/qcom-smbchg.{c,h}: Qualcomm switch-mode battery
  charger (PMI8994/PMI8996/PMI8950), by Yassine Oudjana and Alejandro
  Tafalla. GPL-2.0-only.
- drivers/power/supply/pmi8994_fg.c: PMI8994/PMI8996 fuel gauge (used
  with "qcom,pmi8996-fg" on PMI8950), by Casey Connolly, Joel Selvaraj
  and Yassine Oudjana. GPL-2.0-only.
- drivers/soc/qcom/pmic-sec-write.c and include/soc/qcom/pmic-sec-write.h:
  helper for writes to secure-access PMIC registers, needed by smbchg.

Without these, mainline leaves the PMI8950 charger unconfigured: input
power only sustains the system load and the battery does not charge.
